    "Prepared only. A plan file and approval-reference string cannot authorize a native launch.",
    "One finite alternative ready-publication run of the retained 23 observations and one forwarded R3 signal; not a retry of the retired preloaded snapshot launcher.",
    "Use the already running local Linux engine and cached pinned image only. No Desktop starts/stops, downloads, networks, ports, other-project mounts, deletions or paid services.",
    "Capture at most eight existing full container IDs and minimal nonsecret start/restart, resource, network and mount metadata. Preserve them; no environments, commands, logs, credentials or file contents are read.",
    "Stop before creation on missing image, control/socket mount, host namespace, ambiguous path, private-path overlap or resource failure. During execution, any baseline or unknown-workload drift aborts this run; cleanup targets only the exact owned collector.",
